  "problem": "Which of the following could be the graph of a function $f(x)$ that satisfies the conditions below?\n\n- ${f}^{′}(2)=0$\n\n- if $x\\in (-\\infty ,2)$ then ${f}^{′}(x)<0$\n\n- if $x\\in (2,\\infty )$ then ${f}^{″}(x)<0$",
